   "id": 534343,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the measure of each interior angle of a regular hexagon.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A regular hexagon has six sides, so <span data-math=\"n = 6\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The measure of each interior angle of a regular polygon with <i>n</i> sides is given by <span data-math=\"a = \\frac{{\\left( {n - 2} \\right)180^\\circ }}{n}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"a = \\frac{{\\left( {n - 2} \\right)180^\\circ }}{n} = \\frac{{\\left( {6 - 2} \\right)180^\\circ }}{6} = \\frac{{\\left( 4 \\right)180^\\circ }}{6} = \\frac{{720}}{6} = 120^\\circ \"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{120^ \\circ }\">{120^ \\circ }</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
